  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia Infrastructure and Finance Compact - Access to Finance for Women-owned/Micro-, Small and Medium Enterprises Finance (MSME Finance) Project - Capacity Building Activity: MSME Capacity Enhancement Activity. This activity will support growth-oriented W/MSMEs that are in an earlier stage of their journey towards formalization and eventually towards formal finance. The activity will provide capacity enhancement training to eligible MSMEs to develop business skills, access markets, and increase sales.</narrative>
  </description>
